OL,3,GNEWSATwo men deny murder of cyclist who
OL,4,Awas punched
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have denied murder after the
OL,7,Fdeath of a 27-year-old cyclist in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FGeorge Glover was punched as he rode
OL,11,Falong Narborough Road, close to the
OL,12,Fjunction with Noel Street, at about
OL,13,F06:30 BST on 17 August. He died in
OL,14,Fhospital on 20 August, Leicestershire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
