OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSATwo men deny murder of cyclist who
OL,4,Awas punched
OL,5,
OL,6,FChae Smith, 31, and 25-year-old Joshua
OL,7,FCook, both of no fixed address, pleaded
OL,8,Fnot guilty to murder, manslaughter and
OL,9,Fone count of robbery at Leicester Crown
OL,10,FCourt on Thursday. Louise O'Connor, 39,
OL,11,Fof Noel Street, Leicester, denied one
OL,12,Fcount of robbery.
OL,14,FJudge Timothy Spencer KC told Smith,
OL,15,FCook and O'Connor they were due to
OL,16,Fstand trial on 1 February.
